'''Swordsman''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 64
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Swordsman
|name2 = Swordsman Johnny
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Swordsman Johnny''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Swordsman is one of the worst units in the entire game. Early-game he's far too expensive to upgrade due to being a gacha rare, and later on he's outclassed by every other meatshield due to his high cost and no other abilities to make up for it. The most you'll see of this disgrace of a unit is as a meatshield in the [[Underground Labyrinth]], due to meatshields being pretty limited and valuable there.

At least he can help to get some [[User Rank]], if you don't have any cheaper (in terms of upgrade cost) or better unit to upgrade, that is.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

